+   /* PROTOTYPE: end-of-tile shader cache. pvr compiled this shader with pco
+    * for every render (9 % of phoc's CPU during a panel gesture on GX6250,
+    * measured with perf). It depends only on the props below, including the
+    * PBE state words (render target addresses), so a compositor cycling
